# OPTIONAL. Copy to local.env (gitignored), fill in, `chmod 600 local.env`.
# Plain KEY=value lines (no shell). Every `make` target reads, in this order
# (environment first, then the first file that sets a key wins):
#   ~/.config/artzima/infisical.env          admin identity (INFISICAL_UNIVERSAL_AUTH_CLIENT_ID/_SECRET)
#   ~/.config/artzima/infisical-project.env  INFISICAL_HOST/_PROJECT_ID/_PROJECT_SLUG/_ENV
#   ./local.env                              this file
# (paths: $ARTZIMA_INFISICAL_ENV, $ARTZIMA_INFISICAL_PROJECT, $ARTZIMA_LOCAL_ENV).
# Not needed for the normal flow (docs/OPERATOR-SETUP.md). The ESO identity is created by
# `make bootstrap` and read from Infisical /tofu/ESO_CLIENT_* by `make eso-bootstrap`.

# Optional overrides of ansible/group_vars/all/infisical.yml:
# INFISICAL_HOST=https://app.infisical.com
# INFISICAL_PROJECT_ID=
# INFISICAL_ENV=prod
